--TEST--
inside the string converted with `as property<T>` the list is every public property `T` declares or inherits, each with its declared type, and never a `protected` or `private` one, because the conversion accepts no other name — `rule:types/property-key`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Person {
    public string $name = "ada";
    protected string $note = "kept";
}
class User extends Person {
    public int $age = 3;
    private string $secret = "hidden";
}

property<User> $key = '<|>' as property<User>;
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
age     property  int
name    property  string
